pped by this place since I heard that they sell NY style bagels. Humble's bagels are good, but they are so out of the way for me. I think I found my new bagel spot for when I am itching for a bagel. What I like about this place is that it feels cozy and warm. The coffee and baked goods are priced reasonably. Perfect to study, relax, or get some work done. I saw their display case and decided to try their Morning Harvest Muffin & Croissant. All the baked goods were super fresh and not too overly sweet. I brought the bagel home after sitting for half a day, and it still feels soft & bouncy when I poke into it. Yay! I put it in the toaster oven for a few minutes and it was crispy and the ..."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"vT1zrTTIji2JDhUHjFKopg","photo_id":"pI6yMw-9V-80WOL4PZND-Q","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/pI6yMw-9V-80WOL4PZND-Q.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9255346655845642},{"business_id":"vT1zrTTIji2JDhUHjFKopg","photo_id":"dZWXHKWqh15-YLlYTAxxsQ","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/dZWXHKWqh15-YLlYTAxxsQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.905110239982605},{"business_id":"vT1zrTTIji2JDhUHjFKopg","photo_id":"i-4P_iLhWIDuwoQ5Nxb2fw","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/i-4P_iLhWIDuwoQ5Nxb2fw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8579028844833374},{"business_id":"vT1zrTTIji2JDhUHjFKopg","photo_id":"H_KVcWyZ-_4qc7a0uUGQcg","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/H_KVcWyZ-_4qc7a0uUGQcg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.7282620072364807}]},"notebook_case":null}
